From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:46:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] Revert "phy: qcom: qmp-combo: Leave the USB PCS alone
 in DP-only mode"

The v1 of this fix (q90n) is replaced by its v2 (pw 1192123), which also
covers an orientation flip while in DP-only mode and the power-off path
when DP-only mode is left.

This reverts commit b8f735f43cf95a8ed77c3ea4118a0b1e20594da2.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c | 18 +++++++-----------
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
index f5fe18bb1a52..00520433919d 100644
--- a/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
+++ b/drivers/phy/qualcomm/phy-qcom-qmp-combo.c
@@ -4557,12 +4557,10 @@ static int qmp_combo_usb_init(struct phy *phy)
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
 
-	if (qmp->qmpphy_mode != QMPPHY_MODE_DP_ONLY) {
-		ret = qmp_combo_usb_power_on(phy);
-		if (ret) {
-			qmp_combo_com_exit(qmp, false);
-			return ret;
-		}
+	ret = qmp_combo_usb_power_on(phy);
+	if (ret) {
+		qmp_combo_com_exit(qmp, false);
+		return ret;
 	}
 
 	qmp->usb_init_count++;
@@ -4584,11 +4582,9 @@ static int qmp_combo_usb_exit(struct phy *phy)
 		return 0;
 	}
 
-	if (qmp->qmpphy_mode != QMPPHY_MODE_DP_ONLY) {
-		ret = qmp_combo_usb_power_off(phy);
-		if (ret)
-			return ret;
-	}
+	ret = qmp_combo_usb_power_off(phy);
+	if (ret)
+		return ret;
 
 	ret = qmp_combo_com_exit(qmp, false);
 	if (ret)
